# Welcome Widget — 5 design suggestions

All mockups reuse data the widget already has: a **rotating greeting** with the user's
first name, the optional **org pulse** (`N members · M events this week`), optional
**quick-link chips**, and the `hero` / `card` variant switch. Ideas marked **NEW** need a
small capability add (noted inline).

Sample data used throughout: name `Kalle`, `12 members`, `87 events this week`.

---

## 1 · Hero Banner  (the classic, tightened)

Big rotating greeting, pulse underneath, link chips at the bottom. The default `hero`
look, just with clearer rhythm between the three rows.

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                                │
│   The prophecy foretold your login, Kalle.                     │
│                                                                │
│   12 members  ·  87 events this week                           │
│                                                                │
│   ⟨ ⚡ Pipeline ⟩   ⟨ 📋 My Tasks ⟩   ⟨ 🔗 Vendor Sheet ⟩      │
│                                                                │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

`variant: hero` · `showPulse: true` · `links: [...]`

---

## 2 · Split — greeting left, pulse tiles right

Greeting and links keep the left column; the org pulse becomes two right-aligned stat
tiles so the numbers actually read as numbers. Collapses to stacked when narrow.

```
┌────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────┐
│                                     │   ┌────────────────────┐ │
│  Welcome back, Kalle.               │   │  12                │ │
│  You again? Excellent choice.       │   │  MEMBERS           │ │
│                                     │   └────────────────────┘ │
│                                     │   ┌────────────────────┐ │
│  ⟨ ⚡ Pipeline ⟩  ⟨ 📋 Tasks ⟩      │   │  87                │ │
│                                     │   │  EVENTS / WEEK     │ │
│                                     │   └────────────────────┘ │
└────────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────┘
```

`variant: hero` · `showPulse: true` (rendered as tiles) · `links: [...]`

---

## 3 · Terminal / Console  (leans into the snark)

Plays directly to the 107-message comedic tone. Monospace "session" frame; the rotating
line lands as a command output, quick links as runnable commands.

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  ● ● ●        kingsmaker — session                             │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  $ whoami                                                      │
│  → Kalle                                                       │
│  $ status                                                      │
│  → The kingdom awaits your command, Kalle.                     │
│  → 12 members online · 87 events logged this week              │
│  $ open _                                                      │
│    ▸ pipeline      ▸ my-tasks      ▸ vendor-sheet              │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

`variant: hero` · `showPulse: true` · `links: [...]` — **NEW** terminal skin (a third
`variant`, e.g. `"console"`).

---

## 4 · Stat Strip  (dashboard header bar)

Reads as the top banner of a dashboard: time-of-day greeting on the left, a row of metric
tiles + a primary action on the right. Quick links double as the tiles.

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  ☀  Good evening, Kalle.                          Fri · Jun 16 │
│ ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────────┐   │
│  │ 12       │  │ 87       │  │ 5        │  │      +       │   │
│  │ MEMBERS  │  │ EVENTS/WK│  │ MY TASKS │  │  New record  │   │
│  └──────────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────────┘   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

`variant: hero` · `showPulse: true` · **NEW** time-of-day greeting + date line, and a
"primary action" link kind.

---

## 5 · Minimal Ticker  (the `card` variant)

One line, no chrome. Fits a narrow column or sits quietly above denser widgets. Greeting +
pulse on a single row, trailing `›` to expand into links on hover/click.

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  👑  The prophecy foretold your login, Kalle.            │
│      12 members · 87 events this week                  › │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

`variant: card` · `showPulse: true` · `links` revealed on expand.

---

### At a glance

| # | Name           | Variant         | Pulse        | Best for                    |
|---|----------------|-----------------|--------------|-----------------------------|
| 1 | Hero Banner    | `hero`          | inline line  | top of a dashboard          |
| 2 | Split          | `hero`          | stat tiles   | wide hero with real numbers |
| 3 | Terminal       | `console` (new) | command line | playful / personal home     |
| 4 | Stat Strip     | `hero`          | tile row     | metrics-forward header      |
| 5 | Minimal Ticker | `card`          | inline line  | narrow column / quiet top   |
